Proton Bridge (GTK)

An unofficial GTK4 + libadwaita interface for Proton Mail Bridge, intended for
Linux phones including the FuriLabs FLX1s. This project is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Proton AG or FuriLabs.

The mail engine is built from ProtonMail/proton-bridge, without source patches.
